window.products.push({"id":168101,"name":"Cereal Storage Container Set,TAEVEKE Airtight Dry Food Storage Containers,5PCS/4L BPA Free Plastic Airtight Food Storage Containers for Sugar, Flour, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WZXUHKGvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎉🎉🎉 WELCOME TO TAEVEKE 🎉🎉🎉 💎TAEVEKE airtight food storage containers is made of high-quality food-grade plastic, BPA-free, and harmful substances.  💎With stackable and modular design, it can save a lot of space for your kitchen refrigerator or cabinet. 🎁🎁 PACKAGE INCLUDED: 💜5*4L Large Cereal Storage Containers(135.3oz） 💜20* Chalkboard labels 💜1* Chalk Marker 🎁🎁 SPECIFICATION: 💙MATERIAL:Silicone + PP 💙COLOR: transparent container + black/blue/gray/khaki silicone sealing ring 🎁🎁 WHY CHOOSE TAEVEKE STORAGE CONTAINERS? 💗[Health and Safety] Made of high-quality and durable food-grade plastic without BPA, It is the best choice for storing grains, nuts, flour, beans, sugar, snacks, etc. 💗[Safety Seal]-Each storage container has 4 side lock lids and an airtight locking system with silicone rubber sealing ring, which can achieve watertight and airtight sealing. 💗[Easy to clean] Large-caliber design, detachable body, can be cleaned 360 degrees, no dead ends, very easy to clean. 🎁🎁 AFTER-SALES SERVICE: 100% SATISFACTION - 90 days return and money back guarantee. If you have any questions about our products, please feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91WZXUHKGvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAEVEKE","source_asin":"B08XX1584P","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XX1584P","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XX1584P","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":168102,"name":"OXO Good Grips LockTop 30-2/5-Ounce Rectangle Container with Green Lid","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31J72sVUNAL._AC_.jpg","description":"Prepping, cooking and cleaning up your favorite meals takes enough time and effort, so storing leftovers or toting lunch to the office should be easy and mess-free. That’s why the OXO Good Grips LockTop Containers were designed with leakproof, airtight lids that snap on easily and confidently. Just push the outer frame down onto the lid to engage the inner locking tabs and silicone ring for an instant, spill-proof seal. Durable, BPA-free Tritan Container bodies resist warping and staining, and are crystal clear to reveal contents inside. Lids are also clear to make contents viewable from above. Containers safely go from the freezer, to the microwave, to the dishwasher. LockTop bodies nest inside each other for convenient storage and each lid fits multiple Container sizes. Containers stack neatly without toppling, to optimize space in the refrigerator or freezer. 40.4-ounce Small Rectangle is ideal size for lunch, leftovers and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31J72sVUNAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OXO","source_asin":"B00F434L12","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168102","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00F434L12","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00F434L12","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":168103,"name":"Collapsible Colander by Blissful Living – Space Saving Strong Silicone Strainer, Over the Sink Handles, Flat Folding, Expandable for Easy Storing- Gre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ALzvcxsoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Collapsible Colander by Blissful Living – Space Saving Strainer, Over The Sink Handles, Folding, Expandable. Available in red / grey and green / grey.  These collapsible food colanders are the perfect strainer for fruits, vegetables, pasta, rice and more! With retractable handles on either side, and the ability to squish the colander for easy stowing, this is a must have! Straining is made especially easy with holes that direct the water out straight down.  With two colors to choose from, red or green, you can match them through your home with the rest of your kitchen decor, making it blend in easily. This is the perfect gift for a new couple, a housewarming party, picnic, trip to the beach or any other place.  The handles also contain a special non-slip for those heftier loads. Even when it's wet this grip will stand strong and not let the contents slip out. A large and progressive design! Although this colander is collapsible, making it flat, this colander should not be used as a cutting board for the fruits, vegetables, pasta, rice and other contents. Be sure to have Blissful Living's collapsible colander the next time you need straining done!  Features: Expand for use, collapses for storage Dishwasher safe Non-slip Quick-drain hole pattern Hangs over center sink divider for hands free use Plastic feet for standing 15 inches wide x 10 inches deep x 2 inches high (collapsed) 15 inches wide x 10 inches deep x 4.5 inches (expanded) The digital images displayed have the most accurate color possible. Due to differences in computer monitors, we are not responsible for variations in color between the actual product and your screen.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ALzvcxsoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blissful Living","source_asin":"B07D7G2JVS","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168103","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D7G2JVS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D7G2JVS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
