window.products.push({"id":168160,"name":"Nevfiro 2 Pack Airtight Glass Jars with Bamboo Lid and Spoon, 19Oz Borosilicate Glass Food Storage Containers Canisters, Decorative Overnight Oats Con","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TOg73VTbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★ PREMIUM QUALITY - These glass food storage container are made of high-quality and thicker borosilicate glass, which is lightweight and more heat-resistant than normal glass. They can withstand temperatures ranging from -20℉ to 150℉, making them a durable and safe option for food storage. They are BPA-free and dishwasher safe for your convenience. ★ AIRTIGHT LIDS - The glass jars come with natural bamboo lids that are more hygienic, and the food-grade silicone sealing ring is healthy and non-toxic. The airtight lid keeps out moisture, dust, and other contaminants, ensuring that your food stays fresher for longer. The set also includes 8 bonus labels and a marker to help you name the jars. ★ CONVENIENT DESIGN - These canister sets for kitchen counters are expertly designed with transparent glass, making it easy to see what is inside. The wide mouth design also allows for easy access and cleaning. The food container is equipped with a spoon design, allowing you to easily scoop out the contents as needed. ★ SPACE & TIME SAVING - The glass jars with lids are convenient to store and have high space utilization, and the stackable design allows for maximum storage in your cabinets. These jars are perfect for filling with homemade treats like overnight oats, making them ideal for meal prep containers. ★ PERFECT SIZE FOR FOOD STORAGE - The 19oz, 3.4*4.7inch food storage jar with an upgraded wide mouth is big enough to store spaghetti, pasta, noodles, flour, sugar, tea, oatmeal, coffee, beans, spices, and more. These sugar jars are perfect for foodies and will keep your kitchen organized. By the way, they’ll enhance your home, thanks to their sleek lines and natural bamboo beauty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71TOg73VTbL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nevfiro","source_asin":"B0C13G7NTD","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168160","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C13G7NTD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C13G7NTD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
