window.products.push({"id":168216,"name":"PEYOU Projection Alarm Clock with USB Charger, Digital Alarm Clock for Bedroom with Adapter, 7.4\" Mirror Display, 4-Dimmer, 180° Rotable, Snooze, Dual","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a3OOmgTJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"⏰【7.4\" Large LED Display & Charging Adapter】The projection alarm clock display is large enough, convenient for you to see the time clearly from the other side of the room even for short-sighted or elders. And this screen have an advanced appearance, and can be used as a mirror. Good-looking and practical. Meanwhile, equipped with the charging set that you need. PACKAGE INCLUDE: 1X AC Adapter; 1X USB Cable; 1X Projection Clock; 1X User Manual. PEYOU alarm clock, your best choice. ⏰【4 Adjustable Brightness Levels】The projection alarm clock equipped with high sensitivity sensor, display brightness (4 Level: Bright-Medium-Dim-OFF) can be automatically adjusted according to the ambient light, enter the night mode within the preset time, which is suitable for light sleepers. ⏰【FM Radio with Sleep Timer】The clock for bedroom is more than an alarm clock but also a FM radio. Automatically search, lock, and storage unlimited number stations within 76-108 MHz for your quickly and easily use. Radio alarm clock with a soft red light (4 Level: Bright-Medium-Dim-Off), clearly see the time lie on the bed just open your eyes. ⏰【Dual Alarms & 9 Min Snooze】Alarm clock for heavy sleepers have dual clocks, which enables you to set two separate wake-up times for you and your partners at the same day. Featuring the snooze function, the digital clock gives you 9 minutes extra sleep. To prevent oversleeping, the alarm will sound every 9 minutes until it is completely turned off, which is a good choice for heavy sleepers. ⏰【180°Rotating Ultra-Clear Projection】The Alarm clocks for bedrooms can rotate the projection (-90 ° to 90 °). Can be projected onto the ceiling or wall in any direction you want. Offers a clear projection from a distance up to 5 meters, you can read the time clearly on the ceiling or wall. And the time display 180° reversible, adapting to different directions and ensures an easy and upright vision of time. ⏰【What You Get?】PEYOU digital alarm clock, your overwhelming choice. PACKAGE INCLUDE: 1X AC Adapter; 1X USB Cable; 1X Projection Clock; 1X User Manual; When you get the alarm clock, please read the instructions patiently before setting. Don’t deny your own hands-on ability. If you have any problems with loud alarm clock, please contact us anytime, We will offer satisfactory solutions within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71a3OOmgTJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"PEYOU","source_asin":"B09FS4V58C","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168216","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FS4V58C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FS4V58C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
