window.products.push({"id":168306,"name":"Hamilton Beach Dish Drying Rack, Modern Design, Premium 304 Stainless Steel Drip Tray Drainboard, Compact Size, Utensil Holder Caddy, Slots for Plates","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JwcRYZ3cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Modern Design  The Hamilton Beach Stainless Steel Dish Rack with Drip Tray and Utensil Holder is the simple solution for air drying, storing, and organizing dishes, cookware, cutlery, glassware, flatware, and utensils after hand washing. The stainless steel design presents a modern take on the dish rack that will look great on your counter – leave ugly dish racks to the past  Premium 18/8 Stainless Steel  Constructed from heavy duty and rust-resistant 18/8 stainless steel, the dish rack is durable and designed to last use after use. Unlike plastic or wood dish racks that can stain, this stainless steel dish rack cleans easily due to its nonporous properties.  Space Saving Dimensions and Functional Utensil Holder  The compact dimensions of 20-Inch x 12.5-Inch is perfect for individuals, small families, and cozy kitchens that don’t need an oversized, bulky dish rack. The dish rack comfortably accommodates a wide variety of small to large sized plates, bowls, drinking glasses, pots, and pans for drying or storage purposes. A smartly designed utensil holder with 3 compartments seamlessly organizes your flatware, cutlery, and utensils. To best suit your specific needs, the holder can be positioned on the inside or outside of the dish rack. Have lots of dishes to dry? Hang the holder on the outside. Need to save on counter space? Position the holder to the inside.  Dishes Dry Faster and Utensils Stay Secure  With the metal wire design, air flows more easily around dishes for faster drying while the solid holder keeps utensils, flatware, and cutlery securely in place – other designs allow items to slip through, fall onto the floor, and become dirty all over again. The utensil holder features drainage holes in the bottom effortlessly release water.  Protect Countertops with the Drip Tray  The included drip tray keeps water off your countertops preventing water damage to grout and countertop surfaces. The solid, stainless steel drip tray features a lip around the edge to ensure any dripping water is contained, and unlike wood racks or foam dish mats, the tray is nonporous.  Add a modern touch to complete your kitchen with the Hamilton Beach Stainless Steel Dish Rack with Drip Tray and Utensil Holder.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71JwcRYZ3cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hamilton Beach","source_asin":"B0BKXB7ZRT","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168306","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKXB7ZRT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKXB7ZRT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
