window.products.push({"id":168438,"name":"LAGHCAT Cow Blanket, Super Soft Flannel Cow Throw Blanket for Kids Adults, Suitable for Room Decor, Lightweight Travel Blanket, Cozy Plush Can Keep Yo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":20.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lLC5kU0VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Cute Cow Blanket - This is a blanket with cow skin. When you use this blanket, you can imagine the lovely cows on the grassland. Perfect for those who love farmhouse decoration and cute decor. It can decorate your bedroom and living room, and bring a better experience for bedroom decoration. High-Quality Flannel - This cow blanket is made of 304 GSM high-quality flannel fabric. Warm and breathable, Flannel can give you a particularly comfortable feel and it can make you always want to surround yourself with this cow blanket. Cow pattern pillow cover - Our cow blanket will also give an extra cow pattern pillow cover. When you don't use the blanket, you can fold the blanket into the pillow cover and use it as a pillow, which is convenient and can decorate your home. At the same time, it can also be used as the storage of the blanket to prevent the blanket from being invaded by dust. It's equivalent to buying a cow pattern blanket and a cow pattern pillow. It's so cost-effective. Multi-purpose - Cow blankets are available in two sizes, 50”x60” and 60”x84”. It can meet different use scenarios in your life. It is a very good choice whether it is napping or resting on a travel plane. Small blanket Light and easy to carry, suitable for sofa blanket and travel blanket. Big blanket more suitable for the bed in the bedroom use. Perfect gift - This is a practical and beautiful cow blanket. Imagine that when your friend receives this gift, he can think of you every time he uses it. When you give it to your family, you can use it with your family, with your children, with your parents, snuggling with each other. What a warm picture!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71lLC5kU0VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LAGHCAT","source_asin":"B09PNCXWYM","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168438","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PNCXWYM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PNCXWYM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":168439,"name":"HOMBYS Pin-Striped Modal Cotton Grey Blankets and Throws (60\" x 80\") for Couch Bedroom, Soft Kids Bed Blanket, Cozy Blanket, Softest Blanket in The Wo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7133cfZdS+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Ultra-soft 100% Natural Material】The cover made of 50% modal fiber 50% cotton. The unique structure of modal fiber at a microscopic level is what allows a small, but effective, amount of air to naturally help your body regulate its temperature. As you overheat your body perspires and modal’s breathable nature allows that moisture to escape thus cooling your body. As you cool off less moisture is produced and modal helps your body retain the natural heat it produces. 【Breathable Hollow Fiber Fill】The inside of this all season blanket stays at near-constant temperature and humidity, no matter how wet, dry, scorching or freezing it might be outside. Filled with hollow microfiber, simulate the air structure inside the down, every fibre of this has 7 holes, greatly improves the transfer efficiency of sweat and keep more still air inside. Totally different from ordinary synthetic fill, soft as sponge cake. 【Simple Solid Color Pin-striped Design】This sleeping blanket designed by Italian designers. It adheres to post-modern western minimalist style, and presents horizontal extension to create simple but great. The blanket adds a dash of colour to the room, solid color and pin-striped design is the classic combination for bedrooms. It always looks smart and will never date. 【You’re Welcome, Earth】 Sustainably made, always. We all want to make our consumables more eco-friendly, our Modal Blankets are made from european beech trees. It is made through a sustainable, closed-loop process at a recovery rate of more than 99%. Our modal blanket, you could really call it \"green,\" \"carbon neutral,\" \"eco-friendly,\" or the big one - \"natural.\" 【Machine Washable & Buy with Confidence】Machine washable gentle cycle in cold water. Low temperature or air drying. Certified OEKO-TEX STANDARD 100 and BSCI. HOMBYS promise 100% risk-free. We provide products that are truly high quality and that give customers peace of Mind---More than Amazon's official 30 -day return, 90- Day maximum acceptance of return period., 180 Days Free Replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7133cfZdS+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HOMBYS","source_asin":"B0894RBKN9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168439","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0894RBKN9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0894RBKN9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
