window.products.push({"id":168563,"name":"Motorized Blackout Valanced Window Shades, Remote Control Wireless and Rechargeable Roller Blinds with Top Valance, UV Protection Light Grey Fabric Ro","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qaUxzSc3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"DESCRIPTION: Blackout Wireless and Rechargeable window shades, built-in rechargeable motor with 78inch USB cable charge by power bank or socket, there is no wall power outlet needed, one charge lasts for three months. One Remote can control maximum 15 shades, procedures are set before delivery, it can be used directly after installation. The motorized window blinds can only be controlled by remote,the opening and closing time can not be set and no smart devices can be connected. MADE-TO-ORDER: Motorized window shades is custom made, you will see a \"Customize Now\" button on the top right. You then type inside mount or outside mount and your exact measurements to the 1/8th of an inch. We will send email to all customers to double confirm the size in 24 hours, please make sure you will reply email timely.Two fabric types are available. Blackout fabric blocks 100% light, good for sleep and nap. Light filtering roller shades allow light come in meanwhile keep privacy. INSIDE MOUNT:Inside mount require a minimum 2\" window frame depth.Provide us exact measurement of WINDOW WIDTH to 1/8th inch and WE will take 1/4 inch deduction off so the shade will fit perfectly.Shade HEIGHT could be SAME as window height. IMPORTANT-shade width is for total width including hardware, fabric is 1.2inch less than shade, you will have a tiny gap on each side but it usually can be covered by window frame,if your frame is too thin to cover the gap, pleasse change to outside mount. OUTSIDE MOUNT: Outside mounts are traditionally mounted above the window frame, provide us with the exact size you want and we will take no deduction. The window blinds width and length should be 3\" to 10\" wider than window frame for better coverage. For example, if your window frame is 40\" W by 60\" H, the shade should be at least 43\"W x 70\" H. This is your order size, you will get the exact size you order. If install on the frame, shade size could be same or slightly smaller than window size. SHIPING AND SERVICE: Usually Ships in 3-5 working days after get size confirmation. WE DO NOT DELIVER TO PO BOX ADDRESSES AND APO ADDRESS. Any aspect of your motorized Window Shades, such as Inappropriate size, Straighten Uneven, Shipping Damaged, Missing Components, we will work with you to address your concerns. Limited lifetime warranty. If any question please contact us by Amazon message.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51qaUxzSc3L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZY Blinds","source_asin":"B0B2DPS5KL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168563","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2DPS5KL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2DPS5KL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
