window.products.push({"id":168607,"name":"Insulated Water Bottle Stainless Steel Water Bottle 9.4, 13.5 oz Double Wall Vacuum Mug Tumbler Cup Portable Water Bottle for School, Office, Camping,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314bFZXGuQL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","description":"★Keep Drinks Hot/Cold: Our high quality insulated bottles keep cold or hot beverages like cold coke or hot coffee for more than 6 hours. With our innovative technology, our water bottles stay warm for hours and prevent condensation from forming on the outside of the water bottle. Our stainless steel water bottles will provide the best thermal insulation for your drinks. ★Safer & More Practical: Sip healthy with our BPA free water bottles that are made without phthalates and toxic materials. Our Insulated Bottle can be used for children to take water, juice, or milk to school. This stainless bottles can also be used by adults as a coffee bottle, tea or milk for work or breakfast/Tea Time.The size of the bottle opening makes for fast filling and easy cleaning. Brighten up your morning and your kids morning by filling up your bottle with delicious drinks! ★Perfect Design: Double-layer vacuuming technology can effectively block temperature conduction and convection, improve thermal insulation performance and keep warm for longer. Filter the water and separate the tea. Built-in food-grade silicone sealing ring, no fear of water leakage. The stainless steel return cover can seal and lock water, prevent leakage and keep warm. The finely polished, rounded mouth protects your lips. The bottom made of silicone is non-slip and durable. ★Convenience: The stainless steel water bottle's narrow design makes it easy to carry or place in a cup holder. Portable and mini size, easy to put in your briefcase or handbag. ★Excellent After-sales service: Our products are carefully protected when packaged. If the product doesn't perform as expected, please contact us immediately, we will try our best to help you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/314bFZXGuQL._AC_SL1050_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"jessie","source_asin":"B0B294FWPQ","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168607","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B294FWPQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B294FWPQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
