window.products.push({"id":168610,"name":"BEDROCK TREE FARM Rose Scent 12oz Status Jar Soy Candle, 1 EA","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ScVmXdCVL._AC_SL1213_.jpg","description":"Our candles, soaps, scrub, and body care are made here at the farm with the safest ingredients available. We make all of our own products, breathe the air they are made in, and most importantly use them on a daily basis ourselves. When we began the process of creating these special products, we never strayed from the fact that we are exposed to them every day and want to work in a clean environment without hermetically sealed garments and masks. We use certified pure essential oils, phthalate free fragrance oils, and dyes that are formulated with eco-friendly ingredients. All wicks are cotton or wood. We use 100% SOY WAX made from soybeans grown in the USA. There is an enormous amount of information about the differences in a soy wax candle and a paraffin candle. We have decided that the clearest, most undeniable difference is that soy wax is a renewable source and although we find soy superior to paraffin in many ways, we would choose soy over paraffin for that reason alone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ScVmXdCVL._AC_SL1213_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bedrock Tree Farm","source_asin":"B00KLAK2SE","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168610","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00KLAK2SE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00KLAK2SE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":168611,"name":"SouthShore Fine Living Vilano Pleats, 4-Piece, 21-Inch Extra Deep Pocket Sheet Set, Queen Sheets Set with Flat Sheets and Pillowcase, Easy Care and Sh","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":37.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NgY0gO4bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Microfiber Imported Signature Soft Fabric: This Queen Size, 4-piece sheet set is made from 110 GSM Double-Brushed microfiber sheets that are luxuriously soft, breathable and lightweight--sleep wrapped in soft, smooth and lightweight microfiber sheets. These luxury sheets are easy to care for, shrinkage-free and fade-resistant. Extra Deep Pocket Sheet Sets: Up to 21-inch deep fitting. Our fitted sheets will stay throughout the night, even with sleepers who toss and turn. The all-around elastic helps give the sheets a tight hold of the mattress. Snap into place, and the bed is made. Available in a wide array of colors and sizes. What You'll Get: The 4-piece pillowcase and sheet sets include one (1) extra-deep pocket fully elasticized fitted sheet (60\" x 80\" x 21\" deep), one (1) flat sheet (90\" x 102\") and two (2) standard pillowcases (20\" x 30\") with beautifully pleated hem. SouthShore offers twin sheet sets, twin XL sheet set, full sheet set, queen sheet set, king size sheets, California king sheet sets, and split king sheet set. Easy Care: Our bedding sheets & pillowcases are made of machine-washable fabrics that are resistant to fading, pilling, and wrinkles. These sheet sets are made with our signature double-brushed microfiber fabric, providing a substantially higher smoothness and softness. Wash with like colors. About Us: SouthShore Fine Linens specializes in top-quality and extra-deep pocket sheets, which are a necessity for many mattresses today due to the addition of a pillow-top, Euro-top, mattress topper, or thicker mattress. We offer a wide selection of sheets to fit almost any bed, in many different styles.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71NgY0gO4bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Southshore Fine Living, Inc.","source_asin":"B01BJBSRF8","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168611","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BJBSRF8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BJBSRF8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
