window.products.push({"id":168732,"name":"UNIWA Silicone Lunch Box Dividers, 59 Pcs Bento Box Lunch Box Kit, Bento Bundle Lunch Box Dividers with Animal Food Picks for Kids' Lunch Accessories ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eVGdx5T0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Perfect silicone bento dividers】 Designed especially to fit inside your Little Lunchbox Co Bento, these super cute silicone cups will help add more variety, more separation, and more color inside your new favorite lunchbox. Versatile lunch box divider, the perfect way to keep your snacks separated, fresh and fun, and the cleaning easy! 【High Quality & Easy to Clean】 Made from 100% silicone, BPA-free, PVC, safe and reusable. It is temperature safe from -40°F to +450°F (-40℃ to +230℃), dishwasher-safe, oven-safe, and refrigerator-safe, these cups are soft, fun, and safe, and the options of foods to fill them with are endless! these super cute lunch box dividers will help add more variety. 【Multi-Purpose】Our Bento lunch box container can be used for kids & for adults. When using the Bento lunch box for adults they are perfect for meal prep, lunches, dinners, snacks, and more! When using the bento lunch box for kids they are ideal for car rides, happy meals, dinner, lunch, breakfast, beach trips, plane rides and SO MUCH MORE. They truly are perfect for the whole family! 【Easy to Use】Just need to open the lid and put the lunch box in the microwave, and after a few minutes, you can enjoy your lunch. When you get home you just put it in the dishwasher, of course, It is also easy to clean with a soft cloth by hand. 【What You Get】 You will receive 59pcs silicone lunch box dividers accessories set, including 10 pcs round,10 pcs square, 10 pcs heart; flower, star, and rectangle 5 pieces of each shape, 10 pieces of animal food pick and 3 pieces of fruit cutter, Vibrant colors, and different shapes silicone lunch box dividers brighten kids' bento boxes, even picky eaters love eating healthy meals using these bright, rainbow colors liners.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71eVGdx5T0L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"UNIWA","source_asin":"B0BYYMTZCP","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168732","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYYMTZCP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYYMTZCP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":168733,"name":"Cuisinart MultiClad Pro 12\" w/Helper Handle Skillet, Inch, Stainless Steel","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":74.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612yaZhqUAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Enjoy the Fine Art of Cooking Inspired by the great French kitchens, Cuisinart began making professional cookware almost 30 years ago. Constructed of the finest materials available to perfectly perform all of the classic cooking techniques, Cuisinart cookware continues a long tradition of excellence. Cuisinart's commitment to quality and innovation continues with the MultiClad Pro Stainless cookware, designed to meet the demands of gourmet chefs everywhere. Unique triple-ply construction joins a brushed stainless steel exterior, a pure aluminum core that provides even heat distribution, and a stainless steel interior, for optimal performance. MultiClad Pro Stainless lets you celebrate the fine art of cooking. What is MultiClad Pro Stainless Cookware? Premium cookware that features professional triple-ply construction, a core of pure aluminum bonded to a stainless steel interior and a brushed stainless exterior. Heat Surround technology maintains even heat distribution along the bottom and side walls of the cookware, eliminating hotspots. Premium stainless steel cooking surfaces do not react with food or alter natural flavors. Updated Cool Grip handle design Tight-fitting stainless steel cover Tapered rim for drip-free pouring The Cuisinart Details Designed to provide professional gourmet cooking results, this cookware offers perfect heat and perfect results, every time. The Choice of Professionals Aluminum core heats and cools quickly for precise temperature control. Heat Surround technology provides even heat distribution along the bottom and up the side walls of the cookware. Stainless steel interior is ideal for delicately simmering sauces, perfectly sautéing vegetables, browning meats, or boiling several servings of pasta. Cover Seals in Nutrients A tight-fitting stainless steel cover seals in food's natural juices and nutrients for healthier, more flavorful results. The cover is dishwasher-safe. Drip-Free Pouring The rim is tapered for drip-free pouring. Professional Results Stainless steel cooking surface does not react with food or alter food flavors. Great for classic cooking techniques like sautéing, frying, browning, searing and slowly simmering sauces. Superior Heat Triple-Ply construction includes the unsurpassed heat conductivity of a pure aluminum core. It insures maximum heat retention and even heat distribution, eliminating hot spots. Perfect Balance The exclusive Cool Grip handle stays cool on the stovetop. The handle's unique thumb rests are riveted for perfect balance and ultimate control when lifting and pouring.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612yaZhqUAL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Cuisinart","source_asin":"B0BSRDTJNW","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BSRDTJNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BSRDTJNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
