window.products.push({"id":168759,"name":"Bekith 12 Pack Foaming Soap Dispensers Pump Bottles, 10oz Empty Foam Liquid Hand Soap Containers Plastic Press Bottles for Kitchen and Bathroom","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.98,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c3JitzaPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Safer - Set of 12 pack empty bottles (10 oz/300 ml) made of PET plastic bottle and PP plastic pump head. It’s strong and contains no dangerous chemicals or compounds. Each dispenser is BPA and lead free, safe to use. Saving Soap - The foaming pump adds the required air to turn it all into rich foam, and release less soap than regular liquid soap dispensers do, you can get clean, bacteria free hands with less soap. Environmentally Friendly - Foaming hand soap can be used to lather without wetting the hands and water need only be used to rinse the soap away, which can reduce water usage during hand washing by up to 45 percent. Wide Applicability - Use in bathroom, kitchen, utility room, outdoors, everywhere you need to wash your hands. Other uses: pet shampoo, body wash for showers, dish soap, baby wash, aromatherapy soaps. Economical & Convenient - They're refillable and money saving. Mix 1 part liquid soap with 5 parts water or fill with foaming soap solution. (Also you can use your favorite proportion to DIY)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71c3JitzaPL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bekith","source_asin":"B08639SH8R","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168759","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08639SH8R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08639SH8R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
