window.products.push({"id":168838,"name":"Witchcraft Supplies Kit for Witch Spells, SHYSHINY 110 Pack Complete Wiccan Supplies and Tools Box with Chakra Stone, Crystal, Dried Herb, Spell Candl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":45.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9164DzDYc5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎁 110 Pack Premium Witchcraft Kit: 2023 New Package of Witchcraft Set loaded with witchcraft supplies and spiritual decor items to make a little magic happen! It include 30 dried herbs, 20 crystals bottles, 20 spell candles, 20 parchments, 7 chakra stones, amethyst pyramid, necklace amulet, chakra bracelet, pink salt, sea salt, witch broom, tarobs, feathers, spoon, hand bell, guide book. This wiccan altar supplies is suitable for beginners and proficient wizards to make wishes come true!! 🍂 30 Vibrant Natural Dried Herbs: 30 Variety unique individually and thoroughly sealed herbs for Wiccan rituals, magical spells, arts and crafts, spiritual decor, etc. Include: Forget me not, The one thousand-day red, Mint, Lavender, Red rose petal, Sage, Lemongrass, Clove, Cinnamon, Bay Leaf, etc. And comes with painted guide book to introduce the magickal uses of herbs and a cute magic spoon. It's an ideal kit for interested, beginner, and experienced Witches, Wicca, Pegan. 💎 20 Crystal Bottles, Chakra Stones & Amethyst Pyramid: Amethyst pyramid is a supernatural source of power and energy, amplify and balance energy through their apex; 20 Different crystals are packed in individual jars: Lapis Lazuli, Red Aventurine, Fluorite, Obsidian, White Turquoise, Garnet, Aventurine, and etc; 7 Raw Stones: Clear Quartz, Amethyst, Lapis Lazuli, Amazonite, Tiger Eye, Carnelian, Obsidian. It Is great for home decor, chakra, healing, spells, gifts, jewelry, or collecting! 🌙 20 Multiple Colored Spell Candles: With different energies and messages. This 20 wiccan spell candles for witchcraft includes 10 kinds of colors: White, Red, Orange, Yellow, Ivory, Green, Purple, Blue, Black, Pink. Every lucky charms candle has 4.2 inch can burn more time, it is an ideal witch candles set for spells, meditation, rituals, spiritual altar decor and other ceremonies. 🪄 Explore More Mysterious Energies: Amethyst necklace amulets and Himalayan pink salt and Sea salt can carry on to protect from evil or harm, or placed on altars to enhance their abilities; Chakra bracelet can healing yourself and balance chakra; Witch broom and peacock eye feathers is the indispensable props in magic rituals and cleaning altar; And you can write spells on parchments to cast spells. It is a perfect mystic magic gift for witches to providing spiritual healing, decor and so on.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/9164DzDYc5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SHYSHINY","source_asin":"B09F2CR6QK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09F2CR6QK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09F2CR6QK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":168839,"name":"100% Cotton Bed Sheets Set: Breathable Bedding Sets with Flat Sheet, Deep Pocket Fitted Sheet and 2 Pillowcases - Soft and Comfortable Sheets Made wit","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z6jhzRMsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SUPER SOFT  There’s nothing worse than laying down for a night of rest in scratchy, uncomfortable sheets. These cotton sheets from Isabella Cromwell are here to deliver the comfort you desire. Made with 100% pure brushed cotton, our sheets are silky soft and get more cozy with every wash. The premium fabric will give you a luxury hotel feel in your own home.   COOL AND DRY  Our sheets are designed for ultimate comfort, no matter the season. We use Super Kool-Cotton technology which combines our exclusive fiber finish and patented brushing process to wick away moisture and keep you cool and comfortable during hot summer nights. Though lightweight and breathable, the woven fabric also provides great insulation to keep you cozy and warm throughout the winter.   COOL CRISP PERCALE WEAVE  Get ready for the best night’s sleep you’ve had in a while. Each of the sheets in our set features a tight percale weave for a stronger, denser and softer fabric. Feel the comfort as you slide into bed and settle in for the night. The closely woven fabric made of brushed cotton will provide years of coziness and will only get softer and more comfortable after each launder.   COMPLETE SET  Our bedding set has everything you need to create a cozy sleeping space. In each set you’ll find a flat sheet as well as a deep pocket fitted sheet designed to fit mattresses up to 17 inches. You’ll also receive matching pillowcase to fully complete the set. Pair with your favorite comforter or quilt or use the set solo. No matter which you choose, you’ll be sleeping in comfort and style.   VIBRANT COLORS  Our sheet sets come in a variety of basic and unique colors. Choose from classic white or one of our colorful, fade resistant hues. The many color choices makes it easy to match any bedroom decor","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81Z6jhzRMsL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ISABELLA CROMWELL","source_asin":"B07FLY3ZL9","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168839","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07FLY3ZL9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07FLY3ZL9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
