window.products.push({"id":168882,"name":"Harry Potter – Symbols – Set of Four 4” x 4” Glass Coasters - Platform 9 ¾ - Deathly Hallows – Marauder’s Map – Comes with Stylish Modern Wooden Coast","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wkoKLUEmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"There are iconic symbols that all Harry Potter fans know. The Platform 9 ¾ train stop, the Deathly Hallows, the wording on the Marauder’s Map and, of course, the series logo. Now, you can show off these series symbols with your set of four StarFire Prints Glass Coasters. StarFire Prints Glass Coasters StarFire Prints glass coasters are photographic quality prints fused permanently into glass. Featuring artwork from your favorite movies, these coasters are an elegant way to display your fandom to the world. These images are permanently fused into the glass, resulting in a print that captures the natural light, enhancing the color display and making each image a true piece of art.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81wkoKLUEmL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Trend Setters","source_asin":"B08178M3QL","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08178M3QL","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08178M3QL","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":168883,"name":"Argstar Sherpa Fleece Weighted Blanket for Adults 15 Lbs On Queen Bed, Soft Cozy Fuzzy Heavy Blankets with Premium Glass Beads, 60\"x80\", Dark Grey.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81StMmzR3JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"TOWARD COZY SLEEP: The evenly distributed heavy blanket gives perfect pressure on your body and a unique hugging and cuddling sensation, and thus helps ease your body for a restful night of sleep. A thoughtful gift idea for men and women, Valentine's - Mother's - Father's Day and Christmas. CLASSY UNIFORMED LOOK: The selected color matching offers a fresh sensation of peace and stimulates tranquil and profound sleep; besides, it easily fits in any setting and elevates your décor. 7 LAYER BEADS-LOCKING DESIGN: The inside non-glue polyester padding and two extra polyester layer prevent bead shuffles and noises, which further surfaced with extra fuzzy Sherpa and fleece, so that you can sleep in extreme quietness and coziness. The high-density sewing method enables the glass beads to lock securely and evenly in each small(6”x6”) compartment minimizing leakage. IDEAL CHOICE OF SIZE: It is suggested to choose a heavy blanket about 10 % of your body weight, then add 1 lb. Please refer to our size chart for precise selection. Start with a lighter weight. Only the king size(80”x87”) is for sharing. WASHING TIPS: Machine wash in cold water. Tumble dry on low heat. Do not dry clean. Do not bleach. Do not iron. We suggest to use spot cleaning or commercial machine washing.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81StMmzR3JL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Argstar","source_asin":"B08M62RS9R","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168883","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08M62RS9R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08M62RS9R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
