window.products.push({"id":168962,"name":"3 Tier Indian-Tiffin Belly Tiffin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lmSeShkjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Trendy, practical, just the thing for taking snacks to work or for school packed lunches. This Indian-Tiffin is often known as the Belly Tiffin as its quite wide, this however gives it the benefit of being to carry more food. Tiffin boxes are very durable and built to last, they come direct from Mumbai, India, where they have been used for centuries and are still used today. These Tiffins are great for keeping snacks and food that can be taken by kids to school, or to work. They are also great for picnics. They not only look great, they will continue to do so as they are made from stainless steel, much better than the plastic lunchboxes that are so popular nowadays. Tiffins are dishwasher safe and freezer safe, and can also be used directly on stoves or campfires. Join the Tiffin revolution, and the growing band of people taking their lunches into work in a trend and environmentally friendly way. The Tiffin has three tins, which both have a diameter of 11cm and a height of 5.8cm. When fully assembled, it stands 22.5cm off the ground.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81lmSeShkjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Indian-Tiffin","source_asin":"B00BWZ70FK","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BWZ70FK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BWZ70FK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":168963,"name":"Primitives\" by Kathy Block Sign, 4\" x 6\", Cat Hair (101692)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.76,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J0pE2I8YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"stitching, and fabrics. In 1997, Kathy made her first \"primitive candle box\" by hand, taking care into each detail from the sanded edges to the type of ribbon tied on the wire handles, each was a work of passion. As Primitives by Kathy grows, the company works to give back, starting with an initial relationship with Goodwill Services and expanding into several more charitable causes held both by the company and those the company supports on behalf of their employees. They are constantly inspired by the people, places and things around us. Kathy travels the world to pull inspiration first hand from cultures around the globe. Look for all of Primitives by Kathy for inspirational, fun, sarcastic, and heart-warming gifts and home decor. You'll want to have one for yourself and another for someone you care about.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81J0pE2I8YL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Primitives\" by Kathy","source_asin":"B08CVQ3GLG","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08CVQ3GLG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08CVQ3GLG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
