window.products.push({"id":168997,"name":"Alpha Living Home Flatware Caddy, Storage Large Kitchen Drawer Organizer, Bathroom Drawer Organizer, Kitchen Drawer Organizer for Large Utensils, Desk","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zbDtKIxRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"EVERY tailgater needs this convenient piece! Works FABULOUS when the hostess is organized. Each caddy has compartments that hold items nicely such as forks, spoons, napkins, salt & pepper grinders and even oil and Vinegars. Somehow, certain areas of the house always collect little “things.” Remind you of your desk? How about the bar in the kitchen? Maybe it’s the table in your foyer? Having an organizational “catch all” in these clutter-catching places may be just the answer you are looking for! The spaced dividers are perfect for storing kitchen accessories, potted plants, bath or hand towels, and even gardening tools. This miniature version of a trough will give your home that favorite farmhouse style. Elevate the style in a powder room or full bath with a charming Soap in Tin Caddy Set. Crafted in galvanized tin , this cute set could be used for lotions and soaps in the bath or by the kitchen sink. It would also make a darling hostess gift or shower present.Guests will love this Galvanized Metal Utensil Caddy featuring three small compartments and a large compartment. Use the compartments for napkins, utensils, favorite condiments, and other items. This trendy metal container looks great on bars, tables, kitchen islands, and patio tables. It is easy to carry with the attached handle. Use this party tableware organizer for summer pool parties, picnics, brunches, wedding receptions, and other fun occasions.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71zbDtKIxRL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Alpha Living Home","source_asin":"B09N6T3TMX","category_path":"Home & Appliances"},"sku":"BM-168997","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N6T3TMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N6T3TMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
